            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 6.3</h2>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">New</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>LTX 2.5 Fast and Pro.</b> Lightricks' video models with native sound. Fast goes up to 4K and 20 seconds, Pro gives finer results in 720p and 1080p. Choose the frame rate and a camera move.</li>
<li><b>Audio to video.</b> In the Audio mode, LTX 2.5 builds the video around an audio track, with an optional start image. You pay for the length of the audio.</li>
<li><b>New VFX tab.</b> Next to Enhance, organized by task: Cut out (LTX Alpha, Bria background removal and green screen), Aspect ratio (LTX Reframe) and HDR and EXR (LTX SDR to HDR). Each tool shows the formats you get before you start.</li>
<li><b>LTX Upscale in the Enhancer.</b> Upscale video to 1080p, 4K or 8K.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
